      "title": "Postdoc Position in AI-improved Robotic Welding Control for Large Steel Structures",
      "description": "SDU Center for Large Structure Production (LSP), part of the Maersk Mc-Kinney Moller Institute (MMMI), at the University of Southern Denmark (SDU), invites applications for a postdoc position on the topic of AI-improved robotic welding control for large steel structures. The position will be vacant from 1 January 2027 for a period of 2,5 years. The preferred start date is as early as possible in 2027 and the specific start date will be agreed with the successful applicant. Main work location will mostly be at SDU Center for Large Structure Production located at Odense Havn (Odense Port).\n\nThe application deadline is December 10, 2026, at 11:59 PM/23:59 (CET/CEST) ",
      "department": null
    },
