      "description": "SDU Life Cycle Engineering at the Department of Green Technology, University of Southern Denmark, invites applications for a PhD position in cheminformatics and machine learning. \n\nThe application deadline is November 12, 2026, at 11:59 PM/23:59 (CET/CEST) ",
