      "title": "Postdoc Positions within Mobile Robotics at SDU Robotics",
      "description": "SDU Robotics is currently extending the team within mobile robotics. We therefore invite applications for one or more postdoc positions. The position is for a 2-year period with a starting date January 1, 2027, or as soon as possible thereafter. The workplace is at SDU's main campus in Odense, Denmark, and the work is expected to be primarily onsite.\n\nThe application deadline is November 15, 2026, at 11:59 PM/23:59 (CET/CEST) ",
      "department": null
    },
    "https://fa-eosd-saasfaprod1.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1001/job/4410": {
      "title": "PhD Position in Process Simulation and Techno-Economic Optimization of Large-Scale Power-to-X Systems",
      "description": "The Center for Life Cycle Engineering at the Department of Green Technology, University of Southern Denmark (SDU), invites applications for a 3-year PhD position focusing on process simulation, techno-economic assessment, and optimization of large-scale Power-to-X (PtX) systems for the production of renewable fuels and chemicals. The preferred start date is February 1, 2027. \n\nThe application deadline is November 30, 2026, at 11:59 PM/23:59 (CET/CEST) \n",
      "department": null
    },
